18:49.880 --> 18:51.800
Yes, Hi-ERO particles.

18:51.800 --> 18:55.220
If I can produce some of those, will I be able to recharge this thing?

18:55.220 --> 18:58.340
Yes, that's how the Daimidaler system works.

18:58.340 --> 19:01.010
