19:24.080 --> 19:25.250
I fondled them.

19:27.500 --> 19:29.880
Th-That can't be...

19:29.880 --> 19:33.550
If I do perverted things, I should be able to produce more power.

19:33.920 --> 19:36.300
D-Don't joke around!

19:37.220 --> 19:38.050
