19:38.340 --> 19:41.100
It is true that back there, you did... but no way!

19:41.100 --> 19:42.300
Kyouko.

19:42.300 --> 19:46.730
You're going to have to put that erotic body of yours on the line for the sake of mankind.

19:46.730 --> 19:48.060
No!

19:49.560 --> 19:51.440
