20:02.280 --> 20:05.790
Here! F-Fondle them.

20:05.790 --> 20:09.290
Your guts and determination are amazing!

20:09.290 --> 20:11.750
You are worthy of my admiration!

20:11.750 --> 20:13.540
Just hurry up and do it!

20:13.540 --> 20:14.800
Then, excuse me!

20:16.550 --> 20:22.390
This size, the weight, and the way they bounce!

20:23.300 --> 20:25.180
I-Isn't that enough?

20:25.180 --> 20:25.810
No, not yet!

20:27.100 --> 20:29.560
Not yet! Not yet!

20:31.560 --> 20:32.310
There it is!

20:32.480 --> 20:37.570
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

20:33.270 --> 20:34.820
That same light!

20:35.070 --> 20:37.820
I feel so much power!

20:37.740 --> 20:43.120
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

20:40.570 --> 20:41.820
