21:25.660 --> 21:30.870
Surge with Hi-ERO particles

21:26.620 --> 21:28.410
I assumed so.

21:28.410 --> 21:32.790
Please, Kouichi-kun. Fight with us from now on.

21:31.120 --> 21:36.250
Attack when fully charged

21:32.790 --> 21:36.340
Yeah! I'll fight as much as I can!

21:36.340 --> 21:39.710
And every fight will mean another perverted act!

21:36.460 --> 21:41.550
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

21:39.710 --> 21:42.970
Can't we do something about that?!

21:41.760 --> 21:47.100
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

21:43.720 --> 21:45.840
Daimidaler has finally been revived.

21:46.300 --> 21:50.600
