21:51.230 --> 21:56.520
Don't lose, Madanbashi Kouichi.
Fight, Daimidaler!

21:58.520 --> 21:59.650
Leave it to us

21:59.110 --> 22:01.110
Love love li-li-links

22:00.690 --> 22:01.860
Yes!

22:16.710 --> 22:21.340
Don't worry about the force of the stars

22:21.090 --> 22:25.590
Let's let our power out

22:25.380 --> 22:29.970
It's best to think about who it is that you want to meet

22:29.720 --> 22:33.770
When you want to meet someone

22:33.730 --> 22:36.480
Preparation okay!

22:35.940 --> 22:38.270
Let's go then!

22:38.060 --> 22:40.770
It'll work out somehow

22:40.230 --> 22:42.570
Let's go with that!

22:42.530 --> 22:46.740
When we have something amazing

22:46.700 --> 22:49.490
Our dreams are one, two, infinite

22:49.120 --> 22:51.330
Let's go, everyone

22:50.450 --> 22:51.580
Yes!

22:51.040 --> 22:55.540
Let's make our own happiness

22:55.370 --> 22:59.710
Because if you only wait for happiness to come to you

22:59.420 --> 23:04.300
You'll never be able to have it

